5. Written for this project
   The constitution questionnaire items, the plain-language question bank, the interface text and all English wording, the formula/pattern tables in scripts/kb/curated, and
   the code are original to this project and are under the Apache License 2.0. The nine-constitution scheme is a general classification from the traditional literature;
